error[RB0403]: `early` has no value yet when the initial value of `later` is computed
 --> RB0403-initial-value.road:3:20
  |
3 |   var later: int = early + base
  |                    ^^^^^
4 |   var early: int = 1
  |       ----- declared here, after the variable whose initial value reads it
  |
  = help: initial values are computed in the order the variables are declared; declare it first, or assign this variable in an `entry` instead

error[RB0403]: `none` has no value yet when the initial value of `uses` is computed
 --> RB0403-initial-value.road:6:20
  |
5 |   var none:  int
  |       ---- declared here with no initial value
6 |   var uses:  int = none + 1
  |                    ^^^^
  |
  = help: give it an initial value, or assign this variable in an `entry` instead
